  <!-- §01 Overview -->
  <section class="section" id="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-label" data-animate="fade-up">
    <p class="section-label" id="overview-label">01 · Overview</p>
    <div class="overview-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Kang is Hedge-Bench 1.0, a financial-reasoning benchmark of 102 on-the-job tasks grounded in the explicit reasoning traces of professional hedge-fund analysts. Each task casts an agent as an analyst with a corpus of primary documents (SEC filings, earnings calls, financials, press) and an open-ended theme, then grades its reasoning deterministically against verified expert moves. Everyone is building finance agents; no one can measure their reasoning. Existing benchmarks terminate in checkable answers and grade factual recall; Kang grades the argument itself: conviction, rigour, synthesis, and grounding.</p>
        <ul class="capabilities">
          <li>Realistic: on-the-job tasks from working hedge-fund analysts</li>
          <li>Deterministic: open-ended reasoning graded against verified expert moves</li>
          <li>Reasoning-first: argument and judgement, not recall or retrieval</li>
          <li>Uncontaminated: proprietary traces no model saw in pretraining</li>
          <li>Dense 0-4 rubric scored on grounding, coverage, and synthesis</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <aside class="glance" aria-label="At a glance">
        <p class="glance-label mono">At a glance</p>
        <dl class="glance-list">
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Tasks (V1.0)</dt><dd><b>102</b></dd></div>
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Topic categories</dt><dd><b>6</b></dd></div>
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Frontier models</dt><dd><b>8</b></dd></div>
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Evaluation trials</dt><dd><b>6,528</b></dd></div>
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Rubric</dt><dd>0-4 dense</dd></div>
          <div class="glance-row"><dt>Best pass@1</dt><dd>&lt; 16%</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- §02 Key metrics -->
  <section class="section" id="scale" aria-labelledby="scale-label">
    <p class="section-label" id="scale-label">02 · Key metrics</p>
    <p class="section-desc">Three numbers that define the scope of Hedge-Bench 1.0.</p>
    <div class="kpi-row" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));">
